# Final code quality verification

Apply this rule only in the `algotrading-backend` repository, identified from its project instructions/metadata and `src/algotrading_backend/` package. In any other repository, this rule does not apply.

For substantive changes under `src/` or a requested standards review, use the installed `code-quality` skill and the project's AGENTS.md. Read relevant `documentation/code_standards.md` sections and run `make check` for substantive changes or merge readiness. Report unrun checks. Trivial documentation edits need proportionate verification.
